  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>100</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>49</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>49</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>100</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>100</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now let, the sum of first fifty coefficients be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>-</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>49</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>100</mn></mmultiscripts></math></p><p>Let us substitute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://